{
  "version": 6,
  "vendor": {
    "org.degoras.readme": {
      "what": [
        "PERSONAL presets. Copy to CMakeUserPresets.json (gitignored) and edit freely -- nothing here is tracked,",
        "so it can never break anyone else's machine.",
        "",
        "The prose lives under 'vendor' because CMake rejects any unrecognised field in the root object, and",
        "JSON has no comments. CMake ignores 'vendor' by design, so this is the one place it can go."
      ],
      "when": [
        "You do NOT need this file inside the DegorasSLR environment. The launcher exports MINGW_ROOT,",
        "DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES and DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS, which is all the generic mingw-* and unix-* presets read:",
        "builds go to $DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES/DegorasASI/<preset> and installs to",
        "$DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS/DegorasASI/<preset>.",
        "",
        "It is for building OUTSIDE that environment. The generic presets are gated on those three variables, so",
        "without them CMake reports the preset as disabled -- and 'cmake --list-presets' comes back empty --",
        "rather than quietly writing the build somewhere unexpected. Either export the variables yourself, or",
        "override them here as the two examples below do."
      ]
    }
  },
  "configurePresets": [
    {
      "name": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "displayName": "My machine -- MinGW Shared Debug",
      "inherits": "mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "environment": {
        "MINGW_ROOT": "C:/msys64/ucrt64",
        "DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES": "C:/dev/buildtrees",
        "DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS": "C:/dev/deploys"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "my-tree-local",
      "displayName": "My machine -- build and install beside the sources",
      "inherits": "mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "binaryDir": "${sourceDir}/../build/${presetName}",
      "installDir": "${sourceDir}/../build/${presetName}/install",
      "environment": {
        "MINGW_ROOT": "C:/msys64/ucrt64",
        "DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES": "unused-here-but-must-be-non-empty-to-pass-the-gate",
        "DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS": "unused-here-but-must-be-non-empty-to-pass-the-gate"
      }
    }
  ],
  "buildPresets": [
    { "name": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb", "configurePreset": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb" },
    { "name": "my-tree-local",        "configurePreset": "my-tree-local" }
  ],
  "testPresets": [
    { "name": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb", "configurePreset": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "output": { "outputOnFailure": true } }
  ]
}
